<title>USA: Individual Inc Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Individual Inc Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.41     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,867     loss	 1,720</p>
<p> Revs			 7,333		    4,708</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,321		    9,676</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			  Year</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $4.03     loss	 $0.67</p>
<p> Net loss		  51,017     loss	 6,443</p>
<p> Revs			24,145		   16,733</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,673		    9,650</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q4 and year net results included merger, dispositions and related expenses of $1.9 million and $39.4 million, respectively.</p>
<p>On an operating basis, excluding costs of merger, dispositions and related expenses, 1996 Q4 loss was $0.27 a share vs a loss $0.18 and full year 1996 loss was $0.91 per share vs a loss of $0.67.</p>
</text>
